        "text": "Questions\nLet\u2019s recap some of the concepts you\u2019ve learned about in this chapter as a quiz:\n1.\nWhat is an AZ?\n2.\nBetween a t3.small and a t3.micro AWS EC2 instance type, which one yields\nbetter performance?\n3.\nYou have launched an AWS EC2 instance in the us-west-1a AZ and plan to attach an EBS\nvolume created in us-west-1b . Would this work?\n4.\nWhat is the SSH command to connect to your AWS EC2 instance or Azure virtual machine?\n5.\nWhat is the Azure CLI command for listing your virtual machines? How about the equivalent\nAWS CLI command?\n6.\nWhat is the AWS CLI command for launching a new EC2 instance?\n7.\nWhat is the Azure CLI command for deleting a virtual machine?",
